        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nĩ kya nyamũ mbuku, nĩvo akakyovosya kwĩanana na ũtalo waku, na akakyongeleele kĩlungu kya katano kyakyo: kana ethĩwa kĩtiovow’a, nĩvo kĩkathoow’a kwĩanana na ũtalo waku.",
